---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
const lang = 'en';
const UPDATED = '2026-10-06';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies: none on the notary fees calculator in France" description="The French notary fees calculator sets no cookies and keeps no price or département. Only site stability is measured, anonymously and without any cookie." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>This site <strong>sets no cookies</strong>. No pop-up asks for your agreement, because there is nothing to allow. Details of processing are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>A notary fees simulation that leaves nothing behind</h2>
    <p>Purchase price, département, old or new property, loan amount, first-time buyer status: the notary’s fees, transfer duties and disbursements are calculated in your browser. Nothing is sent to a server or stored in a cookie or in browser storage (<code>localStorage</code>, <code>sessionStorage</code>); it is all gone when you close the tab. The publisher records no personal data.</p>

    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>On this site</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Cookies of any kind</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Traffic statistics, advertising, social media</td><td>no tool</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Technical stability measurement</td><td>Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Stability measurement</h2>
    <p>Microsoft Clarity, set up <strong>without cookies</strong>, tells us about errors, slow pages, clicks that do nothing and how the page scrolls, so that we can fix what is broken. It sets no <code>_clck</code> or <code>_clsk</code>; Microsoft sets no <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>. Each page view has its own identifier, no visit is matched with another, and page content as well as the amounts entered are masked in the browser. Provider: Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland. Retention: 30 days for recordings, 13 months for aggregates. Basis: the publisher’s legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p>

    <h2>Objecting</h2>
    <p>Block the <code>clarity.ms</code> domain in your browser or content blocker: the calculator stays fully usable. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>; complaints may go to the CNIL, the French data protection authority. Last updated: {displayDate(UPDATED, 'en-GB')}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
